      propertyPath: newEvent.dialouge.Array.data[0]
      value: You.. You are the guy that killed K.P right? I saw you. I saw you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4826856590422579189, guid: 1d18831f24a8dcf49bd740a3fbc80d3f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: newEvent.dialouge.Array.data[1]
      value: 'My people are starving and i sent them to run some supplies. It''s
        been quite sometime. since i last heard from them. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4826856590422579189, guid: 1d18831f24a8dcf49bd740a3fbc80d3f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: newEvent.dialouge.Array.data[2]
      value: 'Well if you see those guys, will you tell them to meet me at the warehouse? '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4826856590422579189, guid: 1d18831f24a8dcf49bd740a3fbc80d3f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: newEvent.dialouge.Array.data[3]
      value: Gentleman, I will be on my way now. Hope we meet again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4826856590422579189, guid: 1d18831f24a8dcf49bd740a3fbc80d3f, type: 3}
